🔴 **Why a throwaway account exists at all.** swi_b's `manager` is on a non-default password
that must never appear in this repo or on a command line, and typing it into the DUT's SSH
client would put it in the DUT's console transcript. The dispatch decided a throwaway account
with a worthless password instead. Its password is held only in this session's scratchpad and is
**deliberately not recorded here**; any string of 8 or more characters works (swi_b has
`security-password minimum-length 8`). What IS in the repo is only its `$5$` hash, in
`T33381/swi_b.cfg`, exactly as `manager`'s already was.

